<div class="box-wrap faq-page-shell">
  <div class="box middle">
    <h2><i>What is this site?</i></h2>
    <div class="content">
      <p>This is an imageboard powered by Eirinchan. Each board has its own topic and rules.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="box middle">
    <h2><i>How do I post?</i></h2>
    <div class="content">
      <p>
        Open a board, complete the post form, and submit it. A name is optional unless the board says otherwise.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="box middle">
    <h2><i>How do I reply or quote?</i></h2>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Open a thread and use its reply form. Click a post number to insert a quote link.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="box middle">
    <h2><i>Where are site policies?</i></h2>
    <div class="content">
      <p>
        Read the <a href="/rules">rules page</a>. Board-specific rules may also appear on each board.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
